  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the generation and dissemination of LMIS in line with international standards on labour statistics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO support will be provided towards enhanced institutional capacities of Bureau of Statistics to produce, compile and use the tools provided to promote decent work.
Specifically, Lesotho will have strengthened their labour market statistics, standards and information systems through improved statistical surveys and use of other statistical sources</narrative>
  </description>
